    "turn_text": "we wanted to take up too much your time to talk a little bit about the debate last night and a few other things uh... there were a lot of things that were interesting last night uh... one of the themes i think with regard to you couple of the candidates uh... secretary castro senator harris they both the sort of drop this line about how we want to thank Senator Sanders, thank you. Give you credit for your moving the Medicare debate. But the subtext of it was essentially, we'll take it from here. Thanks a lot, Bernie. We'll take it from here. Where do they want to take it, and why is that a bad idea? What's the difference between what you're saying",
