    "turn_text": "So last night, it was interesting, it would be before the debate, there was a pharmaceutical lobby, the Partnership for America's Healthcare. Future, they were sort of urging candidates to equate Medicare for all with raising middle class taxes or a middle class tax hike. And right on cue, Vice President Biden does that. I mean, is that gonna be a new talking point that you're gonna have to deal with with",
