        "text": "Engaging Trump in personal attacks undermines effective political messaging.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Focusing on core issues is more persuasive than responding to provocations.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The media’s interest in conflict drives candidates toward inflammatory rhetoric.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A candidate's strategy should prioritize voter engagement over reaction to opponents.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The interlocutor has the capacity and intention to maintain strategic composure under pressure.",
